&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Embedded SoftwareDesign and Programming&lt;br /&gt;Exam project - WS 25/26&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Prof. Dr.-Ing. Mürsel Yildiz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Group 6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Vincent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt; Siebert (43130), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Hamza&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt; Mubashir Fauzi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;(471554), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Wasif&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt; Gul(477118), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Hüseyin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt; Safa Ünlü(477019)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;This project covers; 7 points given in the description.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;How It Works: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1. Code using the text box given on the left side.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;2. Once code changed code has to be built.&lt;br /&gt;3. Once code built simulator can be run.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;Possible CLI Error:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;CLI path error.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You should fix the possible path for CLI on arduinocompiler.cpp line 42.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Consolas','Courier New','monospace'; font-size:14px; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;possiblePaths&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Consolas','Courier New','monospace'; font-size:14px; color:#cccccc;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Consolas','Courier New','monospace'; font-size:14px; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt; &amp;quot;C:/Users/ibaha/arduino-cli_1.4.1_Windows_64bit/arduino-cli.exe&amp;quot;; // Safa&lt;br /&gt;Change the path according to your parth on your computer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;2-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Syntax Error:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Supported Syntax:If-Else-While-digitalRead-digitalWrite-setPin-Setup-Loop&lt;br /&gt;If you use other syntax or make a syntax mistake simulator and/or build won't work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
